  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the number of men participating in tournament <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math>.</p><p>Number of women participating in tournament <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p><p>Each player will play<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> games with every other player and two women will play <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> games with each man.</p><p>Total numbers of games played by women&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>Total number of games played by men&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>m</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>From given data</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>66</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>66</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
